It is perfection.
这简直完美。

1138
00:54:01.110 --> 00:54:02.070
And you're right.
你说得对。

1139
00:54:02.230 --> 00:54:03.690
There's a deleted talking head.
还有一个删减的采访镜头。

1140
00:54:03.890 --> 00:54:08.410
And then there is even more to this scene in the script that is deleted.
而且剧本里这场戏还有更多被删减的内容。

1141
00:54:08.630 --> 00:54:15.010
So if you want to see like an extended version of this genius, please visit the deleted scenes.
所以如果你想看这个天才桥段的加长版，请去看看删减片段。

1142
00:54:15.490 --> 00:54:16.990
I love it so much.
我太喜欢它了。

