I think I'm getting all the Game of Thrones names wrong.
我觉得我把《权力的游戏》里的人名都记混了。

1161
00:55:28.830 --> 00:55:36.450
But in the Red Keep, all the maneuvering, you know, the Lannisters and backstabbing and loyalty
